The smell that lured you became stronger. There was obviously some rustling in the shrubs. You stopped, waiting for something to come through. Another wolf slowly went out of the shrubbery on the forest road, right in front of you. A she-wolf to be precise. 
"Who are you?" you quickly asked.
"I'm a werewolf, just like you," she answered. "After my transformation I hid myself here. So we live here all together now."
"Are there many of you?!" you asked in surprise.
"No, just five. You can stay with us," she proposed.
It sounded quite tempting, but you wanted to know why you were enchanted, and to take your revenge.
"I need to finish some business first," you said. "But, maybe I'll be back."
After those words you ran off. Soon you faced one more fork in the road.